OL,3,GNEWSAExplorer to tell veterans her
OL,4,A'remarkable' story
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn army officer who set two Guinness
OL,7,FWorld Records during a polar expedition
OL,8,Fis to speak at an event aimed at
OL,9,Fhelping veterans.
OL,11,FCapt Preet Chandi set the records on an
OL,12,Fexpedition to the Antarctic in 2023
OL,13,Fwhen she skied to the South Pole.
OL,15,FShe will be appearing at the day-long
OL,16,FRise and Thrive event at the Maison
OL,17,FDieu Hall in Dover, Kent, on 30
OL,18,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
